{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":34,"kin":35,"engines":60,"usedOn":61,"sites":62,"crewed":66,"museums":67,"hero":68},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/xmm-newton.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":28,"tagline":13,"description":32},"xmm-newton","XMM-Newton","observatory","ESA","Multi (Europe)","Airbus Defence and Space","1999-12-10","ACTIVE","1981-2011","shuttle-and-mir","ESA的旗舰X射线观测站","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"XMM-Newton — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XMM-Newton","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"XMM-Newton — ESA","https://www.esa.int/Science_Exploration/Space_Science/XMM-Newton","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"XMM-Newton operations (ESA)","https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/xmm-newton","deep",[29],{"type":30,"site_id":31},"earth-object","xmm","XMM-Newton 是由 Airbus Defence and Space 在欧洲建造的空间天文台。ESA 的旗舰 X 射线天文台。自 1999 年起投入使用。",[],[],[36,40,44,48,52,56],{"id":37,"name":38,"tagline":39},"gaia","Gaia","三维恒星增18亿",{"id":41,"name":42,"tagline":43},"euclid","Euclid","跨越三分之一天空的暗能量巡天",{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"chandra","Chandra X射线天文台","空间最尖锐的X射线图像",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"spitzer","Spitzer空间望远镜","红外大天文台；16 年数据",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"compton-gro","Compton Gamma Ray Observatory","NASA的四大观测站之一",{"id":57,"name":58,"tagline":59},"hubble","Hubble空间望远镜","标志性可见光/紫外线空间望远镜；5 次维修任务",[],[],[63],{"type":30,"href":64,"name":4,"place":-1,"text":65},"/earth?id=xmm","ESA的X射线多镜面任务。一艘航天器内配备3台望远镜。如同Chandra，采用高椭圆轨道以逃脱地球辐射。其数据已发表超过1000篇同行评审论文。与Chandra同年发射——两台天文台、两个大陆、同一片无形的天空。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/xmm-newton/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
